      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Profuse boundaries between domains of different hardness contribute to strengthening and ductility.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Significant dislocation activity contributes to the improved mechanical response.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treated alloy will have a yield strength of approximately 1400 MPa.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5818523::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treated alloy will have an elongation to failure of approximately 14%.",
